From a89912c95eaf6c67960c02aac838152bd8c3d874 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Mao, Roger" <roger.mao@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:37:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] Add NPU tile/priority config and steady-state inference
   - Plumb NPU_TILES and ov::hint::model_priority through
 encoder/policy/planner;     configurable per-model via YAML keys. Also
 enables higher-precision     ReduceSum/Multiply on NPU and PLUGIN compiler.  
 - Replace per-tick min/max prints with cumulative stats (avg/min/P99/max) for
     obs, policy, and planner-model durations. Skips warmup ticks.   - Drop
 planner CSV dump feature and add planner_log_summary config item.

Signed-off-by: Mao, Roger <roger.mao@intel.com>
---
